x;white-space: normal;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<a class=\"normal_text_link\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU4MDQ4MDQ5OA==&amp;mid=2247494901&amp;idx=5&amp;sn=991e07c1e360e373bf036b2004811125&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"埃塞 瑰夏村 欧玛 Lot048 金标 瑰夏1931 日晒\">\n               埃塞 瑰夏村 欧玛 Lot048 金标 瑰夏1931 日晒\n              </a>\n</span>\n<span>\n              （¥205.0/100g）16g*1\n             </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n</span>\n<span>\n           Ethioipa SWEPR Bench Maji Gesha Village Oma Gesha 1931 Natural\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           我的感受分享：这里面的3只水洗喝起来的感受有相似的红糖甜和柑橘，但风味的强度辨识度也确实能反应价格的差异；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           日晒的4只，我觉得各有特点；瑰夏村的批次从去年选品过程中的感受就是越来越稳定了，前几年还有那种测了一桌子豆子可能没有特别让你能下决心一定要买的，当然也和那时候我们的售卖能力有关；去年开始到今年基本每次测到都能选到，嗯，还是那个风味，买吧！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           阿尔铁里的两只日晒的处理方式很有对比性，我们也有在云南尝试类似的处理操作，也有共性的结果反馈就是低温的环境下处理出来（发酵/干燥）豆子都会甜感，那种自然的熟果的甜会感知很明确，而且果香也有机会变得很不一样；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           翡翠的这只日晒有类似阿尔铁里的低温发酵和干燥带来的水果硬糖的甜，同时也有很丰富的莓果特征；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           真不错！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09ax1xgH4tnoj8XGcqcB0xq0qpiamG0OGs3xP4S0y0Off9n6e47StF5lXdg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: auto;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;outline: 0px;font-size: 17px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 556.1875px !important;height: auto !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: auto;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span>\n           关于订阅补充说明：\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style='margin: 0px;pa